category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libboost-devel libcurl-devel libjsoncpp-devel libjsonrpccpp-devel
sdesc: "Wrapper for the bitcoind JSON-RPC interface written in C++ (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This is a C++ wrapper library for JSON-RPC communication with the Bitcoin
daemon. It allows developers to communicate with the Bitcoin daemon without
the need to pack and unpack JSON-RPC messages and thus simplifies the
interaction with it."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/hkalodner/bitcoin-api-cpp
license: MIT
